#!/bin/sh
# forms/prometheus/test/config DIR: the prometheus form's config for make
# check, in DIR: its user, ops, and password, which test/checks signs in
# with, and one target nothing answers, which it scrapes to no avail.
set -eu
mkdir -p "$1/prometheus"
umask 077
printf '%s' werewolf-check-pass-1 >"$1/prometheus/admin-password"
echo '{"targets":["127.0.0.1:9100"],"admin":"ops"}' >"$1/prometheus/settings.json"
